WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.233 --> 00:00:05.017
A complete salon profile makes your salon stand out on the search map,

00:00:04.967 --> 00:00:07.310
and makes customers more confident to book.

00:00:07.642 --> 00:00:10.297
And once your profile reaches eighty-five percent,

00:00:10.247 --> 00:00:12.590
you also unlock Loyalty cards and Marketing.

00:00:13.189 --> 00:00:14.199
Open Settings.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.640
The card Profile completeness shows how complete your profile is,

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:19.319
and which items are still missing.

00:00:19.668 --> 00:00:22.839
Tap Add, next to an item, to jump to the right place.

00:00:23.426 --> 00:00:27.087
Under Salon info, enter your Salon name, and a Short description:

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.167
write at least eighty characters.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:34.367
Add your Address, City and Country, tick your service categories, and tap Save.

00:00:34.964 --> 00:00:38.131
Next, upload your Cover photo, and your Logo.

00:00:38.493 --> 00:00:42.131
A beautiful photo is the first thing customers see on your booking page.

00:00:42.725 --> 00:00:45.175
Finally, Contact and social links:

00:00:45.204 --> 00:00:50.695
phone number, email, website, Facebook, Instagram, TikTok.

00:00:51.044 --> 00:00:54.455
The more you fill in, the easier it is for customers to find you.

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:56.055
Now take the quiz below.
